{"path":"eval/cases/comprehende-39/expected.md","ref":"1a3d9a3a44e69e8cd551a4a1484c447c28db5c3f","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":1,"text":"# comprehende-39: Support linked worktrees in Git operations and hooks"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":2,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":3,"text":"PR #39. No ticket, no comments."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":4,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":5,"text":"## Story"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":6,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":7,"text":"- Title: the PR title."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":8,"text":"- Why: present, from the PR title. Comprehende must work when cwd is a linked worktree. Do not add a breakage story that the PR does not tell."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":9,"text":"- Size: small or medium."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":10,"text":"- Parts: one story. Two are acceptable, with hook install (a dev tool for this repo) as its own part. Groups: 3."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":11,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":12,"text":"## Groups"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":13,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":14,"text":"1. Drop inherited git dir variables: `src/git/exec.ts`, `src/git/exec.test.ts`, `src/schema/skill-sync.ts`."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":15,"text":"2. Common git dir for repo name and LFS: `src/git/repo.ts`, `src/git/lfs.ts`, `src/git/repo.test.ts`, `src/git/worktree.test.ts`."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":16,"text":"3. Hooks through `core.hooksPath`: `scripts/install-git-hooks.js`, `src/git/hooks.test.ts`."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":17,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":18,"text":"No `dependsOn` from groups 2 or 3 to group 1. The hook script has its own copy of the variable list and does not use `gitEnv`."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":19,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":20,"text":"## Must state"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":21,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":22,"text":"- The PR lists \"Pin package and skill references to version 0.5.2\". No hunk changes a version."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":23,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":24,"text":"## Good to state"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":25,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":26,"text":"- `--path-format=absolute` needs Git 2.31 or later. On older Git, `gitCommonDir` fails, and so do repo naming without an origin and LFS reads."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":27,"text":"- Without an origin, the repo name is now the parent folder of the common git dir. That is wrong when the common dir is not `<repo>/.git`, for example a bare repository or a submodule."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":28,"text":"- `core.hooksPath` makes Git ignore `.git/hooks`. Other hooks there, such as Git LFS hooks, stop running."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":29,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":30,"text":"## Must not"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":31,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":32,"text":"- Do not make a group per test file."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":33,"text":"- Do not tag the intended worktree naming change as Breaking. The test asserts it."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":34,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":35,"text":"## Baseline"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":36,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":37,"text":"- 6 of 6 runs stated the 0.5.2 claim."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":38,"text":"- Runs made 4 to 7 groups, most with one group per test file."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":39,"text":"- In 4 of 6 runs the grader found a major false `dependsOn` from the common dir or hook groups to the git env group."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":40,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":41,"text":"## case.json"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":42,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":43,"text":"- `parts` max 3 to 2."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":44,"text":"- `together`: each test with its code (`exec.ts` with `exec.test.ts`, the hook script with `hooks.test.ts`)."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":45,"text":"- `apart`: the hook script and `repo.ts`."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":46,"text":"- Added the 0.5.2 claim."}]}
